      "writtenOn": "2021-01-12T05:45:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note this CL itself isn\u0027t sufficient to mainline the CS code; this method will also need to become @SystemApi (or the callsite needs to be deleted). So a few options are:\n\n1. Keep this as is and move to another type (NetworkScore?) if we make this @SystemApi. If we don\u0027t make it SystemApi because we delete the callsite, then delete this as well.\n2. Keep this as is and when network scoring lands, have CS pass in whatever value it wants. I don\u0027t think we need to worry about what makes it to the proto because we\u0027re not uploading this data any more.\n3. Remove it here and fill in the proto (which likely doesn\u0027t matter, see above) with whatever value (0?) or even don\u0027t fill it in at all.\n\nWhat would you prefer? I don\u0027t think I feel particularly strongly about any of these options. #3 is more work because the tests will need to be updated.",
      "parentUuid": "4c9b304f_3abd634c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 204,
